Taken unchanged: Main.qml, qmldir, components/, icons/ (without the catppuccin.png and eldritch.png previews), and
the Red Hat Display variable fonts from fonts/redhat-vf (SIL Open Font License, fonts/OFL.txt). Left out: its
backgrounds, videos, demo configs, docs and install scripts.

Ours: configs/theme.conf.in (its default.conf with the distribution's colours and background), metadata.desktop.in,
and backgrounds/default.jpg, which distrokit.build.branding draws at build time.

To take a newer SilentSDDM: copy those files from the new commit over these, update the commit above, and check
configs/theme.conf.in against its configs/default.conf for new or renamed options.
